				<description>You gain a +2 bonus on Bluff, Knowledge, Perception, Sense Motive, and Survival checks against aberrations.</description>
			</skillbonus>
			<skillbonus>
				<description>+4 bonus on Swim checks made to resist nonlethal damage from exhaustion; Constitution checks made to continue running, to avoid nonlethal damage from a forced march, to hold your breath, and to avoid nonlethal damage from starvation or thirst; Fortitude saves made to avoid nonlethal damage from hot or cold environments and to resist damage from suffocation.</description>
			</skillbonus>
		</conditional_modifiers>
